  "goodToKnow": "Der Untertan is a subject of a monarch: die Untertanen des Königs. Heinrich Mann's satirical novel Der Untertan (1918) portrays Diederich Heßling, a servile and authoritarian citizen of the Kaiserreich, a classic of German literature. Der Untertanengeist is a servile mentality. Macht euch die Erde untertan (subdue the earth) is from Genesis in Luther's Bible. Plural: die Untertanen."
